ui-critic (adminhead marketplace)

This plugin contains files adapted from taste-skill by Leonxlnx
(https://github.com/Leonxlnx/taste-skill, commit f624f37, skills/taste-skill),
licensed under the MIT License. The license text and copyright notice are in LICENSE.

Files derived from taste-skill, and how they were modified:

- scripts/inspect.mjs: serves local files from the page's own directory only (or --root, which must
  contain the page), refuses symlinks that leave that root and non-GET methods, writes to
  .ui-critic/inspect/, reads allowances from .ui-direction/direction.json, reports the motion quota as
  WARN, exits 2 with a message when no browser is found.
- scripts/lint.mjs: monospace, index numbering and hairline rules report WARN; symlinks are not followed;
  accepts a ui-critic-ignore comment.
- scripts/lib/rules.mjs: monospace, index numbering, hairlines, outlined boxes and the picture quota
  report WARN; fix texts reworded.
- scripts/lib/cdp.mjs: attribution comment and a clearer no-browser error.
- scripts/lib/probe.mjs: attribution comment only.
- references/critique.md: owner-taste caps and quotas relaxed; existing-system mode added.
- references/tells.md: statuses mapped to WARN for the owner-taste group; cross-references renamed.

references/rendered-review.md is adapted from the adminhead archive's own web-design skill.
agents/ui-critic.md and tests/ are original to this plugin.
